      "block_preview_text": "Observe the origins of asparagus, which trace back to over 2,000 years ago in the Mediterranean regions of Europe, Northern Africa, and parts of Asia. Notice the global production of asparagus, with some of the largest producers being the United States, Peru, China, Germany, and Spain, and highlight that in the U.S., California, Washington, and Michigan are the top producers.",
